{
	"addonId": "github",
	"displayName": "NVDA Integration for GitHub",
	"URL": "https://github.com/MehmetAykurt/nvda-github/releases/download/2026.11.11/github-2026.11.11.nvda-addon",
	"description": "Completely eliminates the complex, cluttered, and difficult-to-navigate web interface of GitHub—the world's largest code and file hosting platform—to deliver a seamless desktop experience for screen reader users.\n\nDirectly perform operations such as Secure Account Connection, Repository Management, Branch Management, File and Folder Operations, Accessible Built-in File Editor, Commit History and Diff Inspection, Pull Requests and Code Merging, Issue and Task Tracking, Releases and Asset Distribution, NVDA Add-on Store Submission, Notification Center, and Open Source Project Search through the add-on.\n\nYou can open the add-on via NVDA Menu / Tools / GitHub or the NVDA+G shortcut; for feature requests or feedback, please contact m.aykurt38@gmail.com.",
	"sha256": "d546e37ee2056b3673152afe8097292ff89a24fcbeeea5475a41975a783e122c",
